OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain will move
OL,6,Feastwards across the country today.
OL,7,FCentral areas likely to see the
OL,8,Fwettest weather, whilst the far
OL,9,Fsoutheast of England and northern
OL,10,FScotland will remain mostly dry and
OL,11,Fbright. Breezy across central and
OL,12,Fsouthern areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain and drizzle, most persistent
OL,16,Fin the far north and northwest. A
OL,17,Frather warm and humid night to come,
OL,18,Fespecially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
