OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA rather cloudy start across
OL,6,Fthe south with patchy rain, but this
OL,7,Fclearing to sunshine and showers.
OL,8,FElsewhere, bright spells initially but
OL,9,Ffurther cloud and rain arriving from
OL,10,Fthe west.
